# Targets for nix-memo-diff.sh: one `REF [ATTR]` per line, ATTR defaulting to
# `drvPath`. The mix is deliberate — a NixOS toplevel instantiates ~2200
# derivations and repeats many of them (mkDerivation called per package), while
# the two nixpkgs leaves are small and shaped differently (hello: a handful of
# inputs; python3: a deeper dependency chain). Add flakes here rather than
# editing the script.
/etc/nixos nixosConfigurations.trantor.config.system.build.toplevel.drvPath
nixpkgs#hello
nixpkgs#python3
